sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User/Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Server
    participant RA as ReAct Agent
    participant R as Router
    participant O as Observer/Operator
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant S as Slurm Cluster

    U->>API: HTTP Request / WebSocket
    API->>RA: Invoke agent
    RA->>R: Classify intent
    R->>O: Delegate to sub-agent
    O->>MCP: Tool call (via stdio)
    MCP->>S: Execute command
    S-->>MCP: Result
    MCP-->>O: Tool response
    O-->>RA: Sub-agent result
    RA-->>API: Synthesized response + trace
    API-->>U: SSE stream / JSON

    Note over O,MCP: Dangerous ops trigger<br/>confirmation interruption
